<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Payment Failed</title>
  </head>
  <body
    style="
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    "
  >
    <table
      width="100%"
      cellpadding="0"
      cellspacing="0"
      style="background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 40px 10px"
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table
            width="100%"
            cellpadding="0"
            cellspacing="0"
            style="
              max-width: 600px;
              background: #ffffff;
              border-radius: 24px;
              overflow: hidden;
              box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
              border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            "
          >
            <tr>
              <td
                align="center"
                style="
                  padding: 60px 40px 30px 40px;
                  background: linear-gradient(
                    to bottom,
                    #fff7ed 0%,
                    #ffffff 100%
                  );
                "
              >
                <div style="margin-bottom: 20px">
                  <img
                    src="https://d1dmb2897axey0.cloudfront.net/default/logo.png"
                    alt="Arts & Craft Studio"
                    width="120"
                    style="display: block; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 15px"
                  />
                </div>
                <h1
                  style="
                    color: #1f2937;
                    margin: 0;
                    font-size: 28px;
                    font-weight: 800;
                    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
                    text-align: center;
                  "
                >
                  Arts & Craft Studio
                </h1>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 0 50px; text-align: center">
                <div
                  style="
                    display: inline-block;
                    padding: 6px 16px;
                    background-color: #ffedd5;
                    color: #9a3412;
                    border-radius: 30px;
                    font-size: 13px;
                    font-weight: 700;
                    text-transform: uppercase;
                    margin-bottom: 25px;
                  "
                >
                  ⚠️ Action Required: Payment Issue
                </div>

                <h2
                  style="
                    color: #111827;
                    font-size: 32px;
                    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
                    line-height: 1.1;
                    font-weight: 800;
                  "
                >
                  Oops! We couldn't process your payment
                </h2>

                <p
                  style="
                    color: #4b5563;
                    font-size: 17px;
                    line-height: 1.6;
                    margin: 0;
                  "
                >
                  Hi <strong><%= name %></strong>, <br />
                  We tried to process the payment for your recent order (<strong
                    >#<%= orderId %></strong
                  >), but unfortunately, it didn't go through. Don't worry your
                  items are still reserved for now!
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="padding: 40px 50px">
                <div
                  style="
                    background-color: #f8fafc;
                    border-radius: 16px;
                    padding: 25px;
                    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
                    text-align: left;
                  "
                >
                  <p
                    style="
                      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
                      color: #64748b;
                      font-size: 14px;
                      text-transform: uppercase;
                      font-weight: bold;
                    "
                  >
                    Common reasons:
                  </p>
                  <ul
                    style="
                      margin: 0;
                      padding-left: 20px;
                      color: #4b5563;
                      font-size: 15px;
                      line-height: 1.6;
                    "
                  >
                    <li>Incorrect card details or expired card.</li>
                    <li>Insufficient funds in the account.</li>
                    <li>Bank security flag on the transaction.</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 0 50px">
                <div
                  style="height: 1px; background-color: #f3f4f6; width: 100%"
                ></div>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 40px 50px; text-align: center">
                <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 10px">
                  <strong>Need assistance?</strong><br />
                  If you believe this is an error, please contact your bank or
                  reach out to our support team.
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    font-size: 12px;
                    color: #9ca3af;
                    margin: 30px 0 0 0;
                    line-height: 1.5;
                  "
                >
                  &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Arts & Craft Studio
                  Inc.<br />
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>

          <table width="100%" style="max-width: 600px; margin-top: 25px">
            <tr>
              <td
                align="center"
                style="font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; padding-bottom: 20px"
              >
                Questions?
                <a
                  href="mailto:support.artsandcraftstudio@gmail.com"
                  style="color: #6366f1; text-decoration: none"
                  >Contact our support team</a
                >
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
